# ---------- Ironforge and Stormwind on the way ----------
FLY Ironforge | Thorgrum Borrelson in Thelsamar
N Look for a Bronze Tube in Ironforge | Viktori in Darkshire needs one Bronze Tube for Look to the Stars. Engineers make it: check the auction house, and ask Gearcutter Cogspinner, the engineering supplier in Tinker Town (67.8, 42.5), on your way to the tram. Not verified: the quest data only lists drops from machines and a vendor in Thousand Needles, so a city supplier stocking one is Classic knowledge. Without a tube you skip the Look to the Stars steps later.
N Take the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind | The tram station is in Tinker Town.
T 2041 | Shoni the Shilent, in the Dwarven District a few steps from the tram exit. Do not take her follow-up (Deadmines). Billibub Cogspinner, the engineering supplier, stands close by (62.4, 29.9): ask him for a Bronze Tube too, and try the Stormwind auction house.
FLY Lakeshire | Dungar Longdrink, the gryphon master in the Trade District

# ---------- Lakeshire ----------
T 119 | Cross the bridge. Verner Osgood, on the town side.
A 122,124 | Verner Osgood
A 98386 | Foreman Oslow at the north end of the bridge: Alther's Mill (new in Forever)
A 20 | Marshal Marris, a few steps east of the bridge
A 98387 @ Redridge Mountains, 28.3, 48.8 | Marshal Marris: Blackrock Blockade (new in Forever)
T 121 | Magistrate Solomon in the town hall
A 91 | Bailiff Conacher, in the town hall too
A 150 | Dockmaster Baren on the dock (needs level 20)
A 34 | Martie Jainrose, the herbalist on the west side of town. Bellygrub is level 24: you kill him last, after the big loop.

# ---------- Loop around Lake Everstill ----------
C 124 @ Redridge Mountains, 24.1, 32.0 | Take the path north out of Lakeshire. Kill 10 Redridge Brutes (17-18, the first camps around 24, 35) and 8 Redridge Mystics (18-19, further up around 24, 29). Mystics cast: kill them first, and interrupt or stun them if your class can. Do not chase Yowler deeper in the hills: that quest is for a later segment.
C 98386 | Go back down and follow the north shore of the lake east to Alther's Mill. Kill 12 Greater Tarantulas (19-20) and destroy 6 Tarantula Eggs around the mill. They poison: cure it if your class can, otherwise bandage and eat between fights. Leave Chatter, the rare elite spider that walks here, alone.
C 91 @ Redridge Mountains, 69.0, 50.2 | Keep east into Galardell Valley. Shadowhide gnolls drop the 10 Shadowhide Pendants. Stay at the mouth of the valley, where Rabid Shadowhide Gnolls (21-22) and Shadowhide Gnolls (22-23) stand around 69, 50; the Brutes, Warriors, Slayers and Darkweavers deeper in are 23-26. They are above your level: pull one at a time from far away, back off toward the valley mouth as soon as a second gnoll comes, and eat and drink to full before each pull.
C 20,98387 @ Redridge Mountains, 58.0, 62.0 | From the mouth of the valley go south. Blackrock Grunts (19-20) and Outrunners (20-21) camp on the slopes south-east of the lake, below Stonewatch Keep; Renegades (21-22) are mixed in. They drop the 10 Battleworn Axes. The 8 Stolen Weapons and 10 Blackrock Supplies are in the same camps (new quest: the giver says "south-east below Stonewatch Keep" and the data has no exact spots, so look for things to click in the camps and loot every orc). Stay out of Stonewatch Keep itself: the Scouts, Sentries and Shadowcasters there are elite. Orcs run for help at low health: finish them fast or slow them if you can.
C 150 @ Redridge Mountains, 47.3, 60.9 | Follow the lake shore back west. Murlocs along the south-east shore (Flesheaters, Tidecallers, Scouts, 18-20) drop the Murloc Fins: you need 8, counting the ones you already carry.
C 122 @ Redridge Mountains, 38.6, 67.4 | Black Dragon Whelps (17-18) fly over the hills south of the lake, between the murloc shore and Lakeshire. Kill them until you have 6 Underbelly Whelp Scales. They cast fireballs: interrupt or stun the cast if your class can, and rest between fights.

# ---------- Lakeshire hand-ins and Bellygrub ----------
T 20 | Back in Lakeshire: Marshal Marris. Do not take the follow-up, Tharil'zun (elite).
T 98387 @ Redridge Mountains, 28.3, 48.8 | Marshal Marris
T 98386 @ Redridge Mountains, 27.1, 48.6 | Foreman Oslow
T 122,124 | Verner Osgood. Do not take Howling in the Hills yet.
T 150 | Dockmaster Baren
T 91 | Bailiff Conacher in the town hall
C 34 | Bellygrub (24), a big boar, roots around in the fields west of Lakeshire, past Martie's garden (10.6, 49.3). He is four levels above you and hits hard: start at full health, use your strongest cooldowns and a healing potion if you have one. If he gets you low, run back toward the town guards.
T 34 | Martie Jainrose

# ---------- Into Duskwood ----------
F Darkshire @ Duskwood, 77.5, 44.3 | Take the road south-west to Three Corners and from there the road south into Duskwood. It leads straight to Darkshire. Stay on the road and keep running: the wolves and spiders beside it are above your level. Felicia Maline, the gryphon master, stands on the east side of town.
A 163,164,165 | Elaine Carevin, at the south end of town
A 56 | Commander Althea Ebonlocke, in front of the town hall
A 96139 @ Duskwood, 72.6, 47.5 | Sirra Von'Indi in the town hall: The Valor Family (new in Forever)
A 101 | Madame Eva, in the house on the north side of the square. You collect her parts over the whole Duskwood trip.
A 174 | Viktori Prism'Antras, in the house at the east end of town. Only with a Bronze Tube in your bags. Without one press Skip here and on every Look to the Stars step that follows in this segment.
T 174 | Viktori Prism'Antras: hand over the Bronze Tube
A 175 | Viktori Prism'Antras
T 175 | Blind Mary lives in the lone house south of Darkshire (82.0, 59.1)
A 177 | Blind Mary. The Insane Ghoul is level 26: you fight him at the end of the segment, when you are back at her house.
C 56 | Tranquil Gardens Cemetery is just south of Mary's house. Kill 8 Skeletal Warriors (21-22) and 6 Skeletal Mages (22-23). Mages cast: kill them first, and interrupt or stun them if your class can. Loot everything: they drop Skeleton Fingers for Madame Eva (you need 10). Keep away from the chapel for now, the Insane Ghoul is inside.

# ---------- The south road and Raven Hill ----------
A 245 | Take the road west along the south side of Duskwood. Watcher Dodds stands on it, about halfway (45.1, 67.0). From here on kill the spiders you pass: Pygmy Venom Web Spiders (18-19) count for him, and every spider can drop Vials of Spider Venom for Madame Eva (5) and Gooey Spider Legs. Keep 6 Gooey Spider Legs for a later quest. Their poison: cure it if your class can, otherwise bandage and eat. You hand this in when you pass Dodds again.
T 163 | Jitters hides in Raven Hill, the dead village in the west (18.4, 56.4)
A 5 | Jitters
C 96139 @ Duskwood, 18.4, 56.4 | Search Raven Hill for the Raven Hill Tome. New quest: the data has no exact spot, only "search Raven Hill". Look inside the ruined houses and around the village for a book you can click.
T 164 | Sven Yorgen camps on the western edge of Duskwood, north-west of Raven Hill (7.8, 34.1)
A 95 | Sven Yorgen
A 226 | Lars, at the same camp

# ---------- Sven's farm ----------
T 95 | Sven's farm is in the south of the zone, south of Watcher Dodds. Go back along the south road and click the Mound of loose dirt behind the tree stump at the farm (49.9, 77.7). Zzarc'Vul's ogres (around 37, 81, west of the farm) are far above your level: keep away from their mound.
A 230 | From the mound
C 245 | Finish the 15 Pygmy Venom Web Spiders (18-19) in the woods around the farm and along the south road.
T 245 | Watcher Dodds, back on the road north-west of the farm

# ---------- Wolves, the hermit and the cemetery ----------
C 226 @ Duskwood, 30.0, 28.0 | Cut north-west through the woods toward the north side of Raven Hill Cemetery. Kill 12 Starving Dire Wolves (19-20) and 8 Rabid Dire Wolves (20-21): both roam the northern half of western Duskwood.
T 165 | Abercrombie the hermit lives in the shack north of Raven Hill Cemetery (28.1, 31.5)
A 148 | Abercrombie
C 101 @ Duskwood, 23.8, 37.1 | Finish Madame Eva's list. The 10 Ghoul Fangs drop from the ghouls at the east edge of Raven Hill Cemetery, south-west of the shack: Flesh Eaters (24-25) and Rotted Ones (25-26). They are well above you: pull single ghouls out to the edge, fight at full health, eat or bandage after every pull, and do not go deeper in, where Plague Spreaders and Brain Eaters (27-29) wait. They spread disease: cure it if your class can, otherwise bandage and eat. Skeleton Fingers also drop from Skeletal Horrors (23-24) around Raven Hill, the venom from any spider. If the fangs are too hard at your level, leave the list open: the route is back here in segment 10.
T 230 | Back to Sven Yorgen at his camp
A 262 | Sven Yorgen
T 226 | Lars

# ---------- Darkshire ----------
T 96139 @ Duskwood, 72.6, 47.5 | Follow the road east across the whole zone to Darkshire. Sirra Von'Indi in the town hall.
T 56 | Commander Althea Ebonlocke
A 57 | Commander Althea Ebonlocke. Level 24-25 skeletons at Raven Hill: kept for segment 10.
T 148,262 | Madame Eva
A 149,265 | Madame Eva
T 101 | Madame Eva, if you have 10 fangs, 10 fingers and 5 venom vials. If not, press Skip and hand it in on the next Duskwood trip.
T 5 | Chef Grual in the tavern
A 93 | Chef Grual
C 93 | 6 Gooey Spider Legs. You should have them from the spiders on the south road; if not, more spiders sit beside the road west of town.
T 93 | Chef Grual
A 240 | Chef Grual. The crab cakes go back to Jitters in segment 10.
T 265 | Clerk Daltry in the town hall
A 266 | Clerk Daltry
T 266 | Tavernkeep Smitts in the tavern
A 453 | Tavernkeep Smitts. Keep it for segment 10.

# ---------- Blind Mary and the Insane Ghoul ----------
T 149 | Blind Mary, in the house south of town
A 154 | Blind Mary
C 177 | Press Skip if you never had a Bronze Tube. The Insane Ghoul (26) stands in the chapel of Tranquil Gardens Cemetery (80.9, 72.0). Kill the skeletons near the chapel first so the fight stays one on one. He is four levels above you, so spells and special attacks will often miss or be resisted: start at full health, use your strongest cooldowns and a healing potion if you have one, and walk away and come back later if it goes badly. He drops Mary's Looking Glass.
T 154 | Back in Darkshire: Madame Eva
A 157 | Madame Eva. The thread goes to Abercrombie in segment 10.
T 177 | Viktori Prism'Antras
A 181 | Viktori Prism'Antras. The ogre Zzarc'Vul is level 33: kept for segment 10.
A 66 | Madame Eva: The Legend of Stalvan (needs level 22)
T 66 | Clerk Daltry in the town hall
A 67 | Clerk Daltry. It sends you to Moonbrook in Westfall: kept for segment 10.
H Thelsamar | Hearthstone to Thelsamar. Next stop: the Wetlands.
